            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "There is an [\"ignore\" modifier](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/cc2f5b542c38b2af234b62196fa5a8621119fb0c/doc/mini-align.txt#L30). See more details [here](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/cc2f5b542c38b2af234b62196fa5a8621119fb0c/doc/mini-align.txt#L270-L283) and [the exported function for more control](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/cc2f5b542c38b2af234b62196fa5a8621119fb0c/doc/mini-align.txt#L850).\r\n\r\nIts suggested application is like this:\r\n- `gAip` to start interactive align on paragraph.\r\n- `,` to enter split.\r\n- `i` to ignore some common splits.\r\n- Ensure the end result is what you'd expect and press `<CR>`.",
